<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body { background: #f5f5f5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; padding: 40px 16px; color: #1a1a1a; }
      .card { background: #ffffff; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .header { background: #4F46E5; padding: 32px; text-align: center; }
      .header h1 { color: #ffffff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
      .header p { color: #c7d2fe; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 4px; }
      .body { padding: 36px 32px; }
      .body p { font-size: 15px; color: #444; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .token-box { background: #eef2ff; border: 1px solid #c7d2fe; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .token-box .label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; color: #818CF8; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .token-box .token { font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; color: #4F46E5; word-break: break-all; }
      .token-box .expiry { font-size: 12px; color: #aaa; margin-top: 8px; }
      .footer { padding: 20px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0; text-align: center; }
      .footer p { font-size: 12px; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.6; }
      .footer a { color: #4F46E5; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>WebhookCenter</h1>
        <p>Reliable webhook delivery infrastructure</p>
      </div>
      <div class="body">
        <p>Hi there,</p>
        <p>You've been invited to join <strong>{{businessName}}</strong> on WebhookCenter. Use the token below to accept your invitation.</p>
        <div class="token-box">
          <div class="label">Invite Token</div>
          <div class="token">{{inviteToken}}</div>
          <div class="expiry">Expires in 7 days</div>
        </div>
        <p>If you weren't expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; {{year}} WebhookCenter</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
